<Project>

  <!--
    Deliberately empty and deliberately does not import the repository root's Directory.Build.props. MSBuild only
    imports the nearest Directory.Build.props found while walking up from a project's directory, so this file
    isolates every project under CStructSharp.Docs/ (examples, examples/starter) from the root file's
    analyzer references (the architecture improvement plan, AP-4.6).

    These example projects use #region blocks as named snippet-extraction markers for the documentation build
    (tools/Build-Documentation.ps1); StyleCop's SA1124 ("do not use regions") would flag every one of them, and
    "fixing" that by removing the regions would break snippet extraction. They were never in AP-4.6's scope.
  -->

</Project>
